        "| id              | A unique identifier for each film. This is typically an internal or scraped ID and not from The Numbers itself. |\n",
        "| release_date     | The official U.S. theatrical release date of the film. |\n",
        "| movie            | Full title of the film. |\n",
        "| production_budget| Estimated production cost** of the film in USD. Often missing for indie or international titles. |\n",
        "| domestic_gross   | Total U.S. box office revenue in USD. Captures only domestic (U.S.) earnings. |\n",
        "| worldwide_gross  | Total global revenue in USD. This includes both domestic and international earnings. May match domestic_gross if no international data is available. |\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. BOX OFFICE MOJO\n",
        "\n",
        "| Column Name         | Description |\n",
        "|---------------------|-------------|\n",
        "| title         | The official name of the movie.  |\n",
        "| studio        | The distributing studio or production company, often abbreviated (e.g WB for Warner Bros., DIS for Disney).|\n",
        "| domestic_gross| Total U.S./Canada theatrical earnings in USD. Represents North American box office performance. |\n",
        "| foreign_gross| Total international theatrical earnings in USD (excluding U.S./Canada). |\n",
        "| year          | The year of release, typically reflecting the U.S. theatrical debut. |\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. TMDb \n",
        "\n",
        "| Column Name      | Description                                                                 |\n",
